  "answer_text": "Here is the contact information for **Advance Auto Parts Human Resources**:\n\n\ud83d\udcde **HR Support Center Phone Number:**\n**1-800-380-4681**\n\n\ud83d\udce7 **HR Support Center Email:**\n**HRSupportCenter@advance-auto.com**\n\nAdditionally, another reported HR phone number is **540-362-4911**, which is listed as the primary contact number to reach the HR department for employment-related inquiries.\n\n**Tips for Calling:**\n- When contacting Advance Auto Parts Human Resources, make sure to call during regular business hours. The HR department is typically available from **10:00 AM to 5:00 PM, Monday through Friday**, excluding public holidays.\n- To make the most of your call, have your information ready. If you are a current employee, be sure to provide your employee ID or other identifying information. If you are a job seeker, be prepared to mention the position you are applying for, the date you submitted your application, or any previous correspondence.\n\n> \u26a0\ufe0f *Phone numbers and availability can change over time. If you have trouble reaching HR, you can also visit the official Advance Auto Parts website at [advanceautoparts.com](https://www.advanceautoparts.com) for the most up-to-date contact details.*",
